  "goodToKnow": "Die Dekadenz is decadence, moral or cultural decline amid excess. Dekadent means decadent: ein dekadenter Lebensstil. In 2010 FDP leader Guido Westerwelle provoked outrage by linking welfare debates to spätrömische Dekadenz. Around 1900, Dekadenz was also a literary movement. Synonyms: der Verfall, der Niedergang, die Sittenlosigkeit. It has no plural."
